                <pb facs="1018" n="904" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg904"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.00/669: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Culbertson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-07-24">undated</date>].<lb/>[Received July 24, 1931—5:45
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>74. My telegram No. 73, July 24, 10 a.m. Serious clashes between police and
                    students resulting in bloodshed and situation is grave.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Culbertson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
